    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Ring, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>The magical spike on the side of this ring allows you to sharpen your focus at a moment’s notice. When you fail a Constitution saving throw to maintain Concentration, you can roll up to two of your unexpended Hit Dice and add the total rolled to your save, potentially turning the failure into a success. The rolled Hit Dice are then expended.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-q8FFHJZe4BAXCSrG\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Sharpen Focus</em> dépense 1 ou 2 de vos plus gros dés de vie et les lance : ajoutez le total au jet de sauvegarde raté. Un personnage multiclassé qui n’a plus de dés de sa plus grosse taille lance ses dés lui-même.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
